{
  "_comment": "Who receives calls and WhatsApp messages. Leads never go to the site owner. 'workshops' holds each workshop once; 'areas' and 'services' list which workshops (up to 2) appear on each area page and JB-wide service page. A page with an empty or missing list shows a neutral 'coming soon' note (the 'unassigned' default). Trial workshops get call/WhatsApp buttons only; the form appears only for a tenant with its own web3forms_key. Every change here goes through a pull request that Muhammad merges. A workshop in 'workshops' that no area or service lists (e.g. a backup) is stored but shown nowhere.",
  "_fields": "workshop_id: stable short slug, sent with analytics events; never change it once live. workshop.name, workshop.area (area or town), workshop.coverage {en, ms}: the line under the name. phone: E.164 (+60...) for the tel: link; phone_display: the number exactly as shown on the page. phone_label (optional): short text shown next to the number. whatsapp (optional, digits only, or null for call-only); whatsapp_label (optional button text). hours {en, ms}: one line per day, from the workshop's Google Maps listing, or empty lists [] to hide the hours box. tenant_status: trial | tenant. services (optional): restricts the workshop to these services ('general' = general repair and servicing); a restricted workshop is skipped on other service pages. web3forms_key: only for a tenant (enables the form). Never add a logo or photo for a trial workshop.",
  "default": "unassigned",
